   "excerpt": "来自萨摩亚的原住民气候记者，为<style id='1'>卫报</style>报道太平洋岛屿问题，目前担任波特兰州立大学"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "reference": "p3#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "photo_spread",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 374.957,
   "first_line_x": 374.957,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "<style id='1'>5 </style>气候变化对土著知识的影响 {v3}"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "reference": "p3#1",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "photo_spread",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 58.745,
   "first_line_x": 58.745,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "科学发现"
  },
  {
   "page": 3,
   "reference": "p3#2",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "photo_spread",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 540.926,
   "first_line_x": 540.926,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 19,
   "excerpt": "brano © Carolina Zam"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 56.784,
   "first_line_x": 55.863,
   "offset": -0.921,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "{v1}联合国教科文组织《信使》 {v2}<style id='3'>2026年1月至3月</style>"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#1",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 59.699,
   "first_line_x": 59.699,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "广角"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#2",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 44.82,
   "first_line_x": 44.061,
   "offset": -0.759,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "6"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.856,
   "first_line_x": 75.256,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "早在卫星环绕地球运行之前，波利尼西亚航海家就通过阅读星星、海浪、生物发光和海鸟飞行模式，跨越了数千英里的开阔海洋。在撒哈"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.856,
   "first_line_x": 74.336,
   "offset": 17.48,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "还有许多其他例子展示了传统知识的价值，在水资源管理、农林业、健康和渔业等多样领域中得到了证明。这些实践远不止是一系列技术"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 57.012,
   "first_line_x": 75.412,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "这些实践代表了完整的知识体系。它们编码、保存并传递跨代的理解。今天，土著"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.856,
   "first_line_x": 75.256,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "社区在全球范围内捍卫他们的权利来保护这种文化遗产，同时积极主张传统知识体系作为平行的科学框架。正如斐济研究员萨拉涅塔·基"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#11",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 57.325,
   "first_line_x": 75.725,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "传统土著知识近年来获得了认可，这主要得益于诸如"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 306.414,
   "first_line_x": 324.814,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "《联合国土著人民权利宣言》这样的国际文书——但它仍然受到文化和商业挪用的威胁。"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#13",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 306.61,
   "first_line_x": 306.61,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "生物多样性的守护者"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#14",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 306.307,
   "first_line_x": 324.707,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "随着气候危机加剧和生物多样性崩溃，世界开始转向那些曾经被忽视的知识体系。根据联合国的数据，土著人民占全球人口的不到5%，"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#15",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 381.9,
   "first_line_x": 400.3,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "“我们观察自然，我们的动物和植物。我们是自然的守护者，我们拥有关于我们环境的大量知识，”乍得的土著姆博罗罗领导人欣杜·乌"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#16",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 306.307,
   "first_line_x": 324.707,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "积累的技能和智慧不仅仅是机械地从一代传递到下一代，还被编纂成复杂的知识系统，如太平洋和非洲的纺织艺术掌握所示。太平洋的编"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#17",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 232.323,
   "first_line_x": 232.323,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "土著技能和智慧被编纂成复杂的知识系统"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#18",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 71.394,
   "first_line_x": 71.394,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "LINKS计划：促进土著知识"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#19",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 71.109,
   "first_line_x": 90.509,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "联合国教科文组织的地方和土著知识系统（LINKS）计划成立于2002年，动员地方社区和土著人民的知识、技能和实践，以支持"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#20",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 71.138,
   "first_line_x": 90.538,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "LINKS旨在建立土著和地方知识持有者之间的对话，"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#21",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 227.996,
   "first_line_x": 247.396,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "自然和社会科学家、资源管理者和决策者，以确保地方社区在治理中发挥积极和公平的作用。该计划旨在加强长者知识的传承，并在社区"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#22",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 227.889,
   "first_line_x": 247.289,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "在其他角色中，LINKS计划目前主持土著和"
  },
  {
   "page": 4,
   "reference": "p4#23",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 384.835,
   "first_line_x": 404.235,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "生物多样性和生态系统服务政府间科学政策平台（IPBES）的地方知识技术支持单元。在这一角色中，它提供支持和专家建议，以帮"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 408.685,
   "first_line_x": 408.685,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "巴西：水上人家的启示 {v1}"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 388.475,
   "first_line_x": 388.475,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "真正生活在水中的人。” 当世界上最大的淡水鱼——巨骨舌鱼的数量在2009年下降到仅266条成年鱼时，保马里族面临着生存威"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.512,
   "first_line_x": 406.912,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "多年来，学术研究和传统知识各自发展，却从未交汇。技术人员到来"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.872,
   "first_line_x": 240.352,
   "offset": 17.48,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "看到我们的食物供应耗尽，令人心碎。我们不知道如何养活我们的孩子。"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.513,
   "first_line_x": 239.993,
   "offset": 17.48,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "黎明散发出一种铁质湿气与火盆烟雾混合的气味。保马里族是一个约有两千人的土著民族，生活在该国西北部广袤的亚马孙州地区，他们"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.8,
   "first_line_x": 75.2,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "在普鲁斯河上，当光线渐渐消退，热气仍在水面上徘徊时，一条巨骨舌鱼浮出水面，吞咽了一口空气。这种声音——深沉、潮湿、古老—"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#6",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 58.241,
   "first_line_x": 58.241,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "巴西：水上人家的启示"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.999,
   "first_line_x": 90.999,
   "offset": 34.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "面对巨骨舌鱼数量的急剧下降，这种对他们生存至关重要的鱼类，亚马孙州的保马里族参与了一项恢复该物种的计划，结合科学和传统知"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#8",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 508.165,
   "first_line_x": 508.165,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "马塞洛·席尔瓦·德·索萨"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#9",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 492.811,
   "first_line_x": 492.811,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "巴西利亚（巴西）的记者"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#10",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 24.306,
   "first_line_x": 24.312,
   "offset": 0.006,
   "lines": 26,
   "excerpt": "barini / OPAN © Adriano Gam"
  },
  {
   "page": 5,
   "reference": "p5#11",
   "layout_label": "figure_caption",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 45.936,
   "first_line_x": 45.936,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "在捕鱼季节，保马里族轮班工作，以便迅速将巨骨舌鱼从湖泊运送到冷链。"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 56.784,
   "first_line_x": 55.863,
   "offset": -0.921,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "{v1}联合国教科文组织《信使》 {v2}<style id='3'>2026年1月至3月</style>"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#1",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 60.159,
   "first_line_x": 60.159,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "观点"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#2",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 38.067,
   "first_line_x": 37.297,
   "offset": -0.77,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "38"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 388.696,
   "first_line_x": 388.696,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "止。"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.466,
   "first_line_x": 406.866,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "量子传感器的另一个令人兴奋的医学应用是纠缠相机，它被用于乳腺癌组织样本的成像。其背后的科学听起来几乎像魔法。它依赖于两种"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 222.513,
   "first_line_x": 222.513,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "在量子领域中不断与其他一切纠缠和解纠缠。涉及直接利用量子叠加和纠缠的技术的新量子革命已经在稳步进行中，毫无疑问将会改变我"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#6",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 222.975,
   "first_line_x": 222.975,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "传感器读取我们的思想"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.658,
   "first_line_x": 241.058,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "其中一种技术是量子传感。我们现在拥有可以感知地球重力变化到十亿分之一的量子设备，这些设备不仅可以帮助研究地球气候，还在建"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.685,
   "first_line_x": 241.085,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 12,
   "excerpt": "甚至还有能够读取你思想的量子传感器。一种可以像骑行头盔一样佩戴的特殊脑扫描仪，其灵敏度极高，能够检测到患者大脑内单个神经"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.824,
   "first_line_x": 75.224,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "同时具有多个值的范围，例如在空间中扩散或同时向两个方向旋转。只有当我们选择测量它们时，才迫使它们在共存的多个选项中决定一"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.824,
   "first_line_x": 75.224,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "这种量子纠缠远非一种在自然界中罕见的新现象，也不仅限于两个分离粒子之间的“诡异”心灵感应连接。相反，它是整个宇宙中最普遍"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#11",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 48.733,
   "first_line_x": 48.733,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "2025年国际量子年"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 48.431,
   "first_line_x": 67.832,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "为纪念量子力学百年，联合国宣布2025年为国际量子科学与技术年。作为该倡议的牵头机构，联合国教科文组织于2月4日和5日在"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#13",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 48.49,
   "first_line_x": 67.89,
   "offset": 19.4,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "全年，全球的科学家、教育工作者和公民被邀请探索和庆祝量子创新。全球活动提升了公众意识并促进了合作，突出了量子科学在可持续"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#14",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 76.775,
   "first_line_x": 106.775,
   "offset": 30.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "在量子领域，一切事物总是在不断地与其他事物纠缠和解纠缠。"
  },
  {
   "page": 6,
   "reference": "p6#15",
   "layout_label": "fallback_line",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 413.367,
   "first_line_x": 413.367,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 40,
   "excerpt": "r The UNESCO Courier éniako fo © Boris Sém"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 56.784,
   "first_line_x": 55.863,
   "offset": -0.921,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "{v1}联合国教科文组织《信使》 {v2}<style id='3'>2026年1月至3月</style>"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#1",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 59.699,
   "first_line_x": 59.699,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "广角"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#2",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 40.19,
   "first_line_x": 38.232,
   "offset": -1.958,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "12"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.515,
   "first_line_x": 406.915,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "由摩洛哥阿甘树（<style id='1'>阿甘树</style>）的坚果生产的油提供了另一个例子。阿甘油现在被用于全球"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.478,
   "first_line_x": 406.878,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 12,
   "excerpt": "并非所有与遗传资源相关的土著知识的商业使用都构成生物盗窃；有些项目是互利的。例如，澳大利亚的Indjalandji-Dh"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.691,
   "first_line_x": 241.091,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "然而，有人批评生物发现是对土著和其他地方人民开发的知识的“搭便车”。当他们的知识在科学研究、产品开发或商业化中没有得到充"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#6",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 222.624,
   "first_line_x": 222.624,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "利益分享的斗争"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.511,
   "first_line_x": 240.91,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 9,
   "excerpt": "卡瓦（<style id='1'>醉椒</style>），一种原产于太平洋的胡椒科植物，似乎是土著和当地社区开发知识被不"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.685,
   "first_line_x": 75.085,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "世界上有着多样化的土著人民、文化、语言和知识体系。这些体系经过数百年或数千年的发展，对我们所食用的食物、传统和现代药物以"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#9",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.823,
   "first_line_x": 75.223,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 7,
   "excerpt": "研究人员和公司经常寻求土著对植物、动物和生态系统中其他非人类居民特性的见解，以开发新技术和创新。这一过程有时被称为“生物"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 57.044,
   "first_line_x": 75.444,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "利用生物发现可以为开发新产品的人提供许多优势。例如，在制药行业，研究和审批时间长，产品开发过程昂贵，知识产权和监管保护策"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#11",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 57.593,
   "first_line_x": 57.593,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "当生物盗窃扎根时"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 57.441,
   "first_line_x": 91.441,
   "offset": 34.0,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "在过去的三十年中，国际法规一直试图限制行业对土著知识的剥削，以免损害当地人口的利益。但尽管有这些措施，盗用的情况仍然普遍"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#13",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 495.378,
   "first_line_x": 495.378,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "丹尼尔·罗宾逊"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#14",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 476.341,
   "first_line_x": 493.341,
   "offset": 17.0,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "他是新南威尔士大学（澳大利亚）艺术学院的教授兼研究副院长，他的研究重点是自然和知识的监管。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#15",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 499.51,
   "first_line_x": 499.51,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "大卫·杰斐逊"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#16",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 476.391,
   "first_line_x": 495.391,
   "offset": 19.0,
   "lines": 6,
   "excerpt": "他是坎特伯雷大学（新西兰）的副教授，他的研究重点是生物多样性、知识产权和土著知识体系的交叉领域。"
  },
  {
   "page": 7,
   "reference": "p7#17",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_opener",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 234.143,
   "first_line_x": 234.143,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "今天，许多国家要求潜在的土著知识使用者首先获得知识持有者的同意"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#0",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 443.241,
   "first_line_x": 443.241,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "当生物盗窃扎根时 {v1}"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#1",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 388.475,
   "first_line_x": 388.475,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "用者首先获得知识持有者的明确同意，并签署详细说明如何分享利益的协议。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#2",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.337,
   "first_line_x": 406.737,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 8,
   "excerpt": "此外，越来越多的法律要求知识产权申请者——尤其是专利申请者——披露任何用于创造发明的遗传资源或传统知识的来源。随着202"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#3",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 388.475,
   "first_line_x": 406.875,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 12,
   "excerpt": "但尽管有这些措施，由于系统中存在可利用的漏洞，生物盗窃仍然发生。例如，可以通过从未采纳限制性立法的国家收集遗传资源或传统"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#4",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 222.649,
   "first_line_x": 222.649,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "十世纪中期遗传学科学的新发展，基于或衍生自生物多样性的产品被理解为“遗传资源”。这与基于潜在用途而非仅实际用途为生物多样"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#5",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.685,
   "first_line_x": 241.085,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 13,
   "excerpt": "20世纪90年代，由于一些发展，情况发生了巨大变化。首先，知识产权在世界贸易组织（WTO）协议下得到了统一，这改变了各国"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#6",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 222.975,
   "first_line_x": 222.975,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 1,
   "excerpt": "明确的同意"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#7",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 222.511,
   "first_line_x": 239.99,
   "offset": 17.48,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "过去30年间建立的强化国际规则和协议框架带来了一些积极的变化。如今，许多国家要求潜在的土著知识使"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#8",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 56.861,
   "first_line_x": 56.861,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 3,
   "excerpt": "议已经分享的利益包括为第一民族青年提供就业机会以及为澳大利亚土著提供培训和教育机会的资金。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#9",
   "layout_label": "title",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 57.148,
   "first_line_x": 57.148,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "私人财产的共同遗产？"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#10",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.684,
   "first_line_x": 75.084,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 4,
   "excerpt": "生物盗窃问题的根源在于一个历史性的转变：全球社会开始将生物资源视为专有资产，而非共享遗产的那一刻。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#11",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.822,
   "first_line_x": 75.222,
   "offset": 18.4,
   "lines": 10,
   "excerpt": "植物、动物和其他生物多样性成分在全球范围内的流通以及不同人群之间相关知识的共享并不是什么新鲜事。在欧洲殖民时代之前，各种"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#12",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 56.85,
   "first_line_x": 74.33,
   "offset": 17.48,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "在人类历史的大部分时间里，国际法将此类生物资源视为“人类共同的遗产”，这意味着任何人都可以获取和使用这些资源，而无需获得"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#13",
   "layout_label": "plain text",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": true,
   "box_x": 437.863,
   "first_line_x": 467.863,
   "offset": 30.0,
   "lines": 5,
   "excerpt": "千百年来，柏柏尔女性一直使用阿甘油，这种产品现在已在全球范围内商业化。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#14",
   "layout_label": "figure_caption",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 416.298,
   "first_line_x": 416.298,
   "offset": 0.0,
   "lines": 2,
   "excerpt": "摩洛哥西南部塔夫拉乌特的一家女性合作社的阿甘油生产车间。"
  },
  {
   "page": 8,
   "reference": "p8#15",
   "layout_label": "abandon",
   "page_kind": "article_body",
   "first_line_indent": false,
   "box_x": 17.242,
